    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Chicago",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>9. October 2025 | 3 min read | Peter Jilke</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "From swimming with a view of skyscrapers to enjoying deep-dish pizza and much more, long-haul purser Peter-Jürgen Jilke reveals his tips for an unforgettable day in Chicago.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Morning</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "HEADLINE",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_lou-mitchells_coffee_alamy-T5DMN8_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Exterior view of the iconic Lou Mitchell’s diner in Chicago with yellow umbrellas and guests dining on the patio."
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Breakfast at Lou Mitchell's</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>For me, the perfect day in Chicago starts with breakfast at Lou Mitchell's diner, located right at the beginning of the famous Route 66.</li><li>Portions are generous and the pancakes are simply phenomenal.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "565 W. Jackson Blvd",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Lake Michigan From Above</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>A must-do is visiting the Skydeck of Chicago's tallest skyscraper, the Willis Tower. Standing on the glass floor, you'll be looking straight down at the city beneath your feet.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "233 S. Wacker Dr",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Midday</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_deep-dish-pizza_gettyimages1859952448_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Close-up of a classic Chicago-style deep-dish pizza served in a cast-iron pan."
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par7/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Lunch at Pizzeria Uno</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Deep-dish pizza with its famously thick crust is a true Chicago specialty. In my opinion, it tastes best at Pizzeria Uno.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "29 East Ohio St",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par10/separator_copy_copy_"
     },
