     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par10/separator_copy_copy__469744435"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par11/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_riverwalk_shutterstock2046416633_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "View of the Chicago skyline from the Riverwalk"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par11/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Relaxing at the Riverwalk</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>The Riverwalk stretches right through the city along the Chicago River, leading all the way to Lake Michigan.</li><li>I love grabbing a lounge chair here, watching kayaks and electric boats pass by, and gazing up at the skyline. Pure vacation vibes!</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Ohio Street Beach</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>One of Chicago's unique features is its beaches right in the middle of the city.</li><li>My tip is to chill at Ohio Street Beach, grab an ice cream from The Original Rainbow Cone, or go for a swim with the skyscrapers as your backdrop.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "600 North Jean-Baptiste Pointe DuSable Lake Shore Drive",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Museum of Science and Industry</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>At this wonderfully interactive museum, I've walked through the model of a giant human heart and learned everything about the invention of the telephone.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "5700 S DuSable Lake Shore Dr",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par20/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_millers-pub_shutterstock_2576464647_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Entrance to the historic Miller’s Pub in Chicago with glowing neon sign at dusk."
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/en/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par20/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Dinner at Miller's Pub</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>My recommendation is to order the spare ribs. Miller's Pub serves the best ones in all of Chicago.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "134 S Wabash Ave",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_23"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Ale House</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_24"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Whenever I sit at the bar of the over-100-year-old Ale House, I end up in a conversation with someone new.</li><li>People here are wonderfully sociable and open-minded.</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_25"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "219 West North Avenue (at Wieland)",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_26"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Copyrights: Unsplash, Alamy, Getty Images, Shutterstock",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_27"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>About</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_28"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Flight attendant Peter Jilke lives in Greifenstein near Limburg and has been working for Lufthansa since 1993. As a Purser II, he is the head of the cabin crew on long-haul routes and frequently flies to the USA.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/en/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_29"
     }
    ],
